      "rationale": "L1 names E221 and V222 explicitly as the junction in full-length human EAAT2, placing the tag squarely within the large extracellular loop (topology 143\u2013238). Python confirms seq[220]='E' and seq[221]='V', matching the paper exactly. The site is 79 aa from the upstream TM boundary (142) and 17 aa from the downstream TM start (239), well beyond the \u22653-residue minimum. The authors explicitly state the insertion is functionally silent, and ELISA confirms surface display. Full-length human EAAT2 (SLC1A2) expressed in COS-7 cells; HA epitope (YPYDVPDYA) inserted between E221 and V222 in the extracellular TM4b/4c loop by overlap-extension PCR; construct designated pcDNA3.1-HA-EAAT2. Surface and total expression quantified by ELISA (L2, L14).",
